        <mxCell id="note2d" value="2-D frame-level tensors are preserved (no temporal pooling). Each encoder may have a different hidden dimension D&lt;sub&gt;k&lt;/sub&gt; and frame count T&lt;sub&gt;k&lt;/sub&gt;." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#000000;strokeWidth=1;fontFamily=Times New Roman;fontSize=12;dashed=1;align=center;" vertex="1" parent="1">
